  "note": "The look of every character (the caller, the regulars and the player). A look is { ball, cheeks, eyes, hat, glasses, neck, extras }. Colours are hex. Hats, glasses and neckwear are 'items' built from simple shapes, so a new one only needs an entry here. A part has a shape (sphere, cylinder, cone, torus, box, hemisphere, or the special shapes bow and headband), its size in args, a position pos, a rotation rot in radians, an optional scale, a colour ('primary' means the colour the player picks for that item) and a finish (glossy, matte or metal). The head is a ball of radius 1 centred at 0,0,0 facing +z. Wearable prizes will point at an item by its id.",
